cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Jev-AR or its benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Jev-AR: Arabic Intent Routing for MSA, Gulf Dialects and Code-Switching"
abstract: >-
  A 322M local decision model for fast Arabic intent routing across MSA, Emirati, Saudi and code-switched Arabic.
  Routes are supplied at request time and scored jointly in one forward pass, with calibrated probabilities and an
  escalation signal.
